{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25267","headline":"赋得亚父碎玉斗 · 孟简","name":"赋得亚父碎玉斗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"献谋既我违，积愤从心痗。\n鸿门入已迫，赤帝时潜退。\n宝位方苦竞，玉斗何情爱。\n犹看虹气凝，讵惜冰姿碎。\n而嗟大事返，当起千里悔。\n谁爲西楚王，坐见东城溃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}